      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-lemon-curd/#wprm-recipe-54599-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Keto-Lemon-Curd-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk together until it gets thick.",
